OL,3,AUkraine says Starlink still restricted
OL,4,Aafter Trump says limits lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine is still recording issues with
OL,7,Fthe Starlink network, sources within
OL,8,Fthe defence ministry say, after Donald
OL,9,FTrump said limits on the satellite
OL,10,Fuplink had been reversed by Elon Musk.
OL,12,FThe sources told the BBC that instances
OL,13,Fof drones experiencing connection loss
OL,14,Fat speeds of 161km/h (100mph) were
OL,15,Fbeing recorded, hampering military
OL,16,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
