OL,3,ATwo Israeli soldiers killed in attack
OL,4,Aby suspected Palestinian gunmen in West
OL,5,ABank
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo Israeli soldiers have been killed
OL,8,Fin a shooting by two suspected
OL,9,FPalestinian attackers in the occupied
OL,10,FWest Bank, the Israeli military says.
OL,12,FThree Israelis were wounded in the
OL,13,Fattack before the gunmen were shot
OL,14,Fdead, officials say. It happened at a
OL,15,Fmilitary checkpoint at the entrance to
OL,16,Fthe city of Hebron.
OL,18,FIn response, Israel's Prime Minister
OL,19,FBenjamin Netanyahu said he had ordered
OL,20,Fthe military to prepare for a full
OL,21,Flockdown of the West Bank, beginning
OL,22,Flater on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
